      en: ["Klaipėda was established in 1252 by the Teutonic Order.", "The city was known by its German name, Memel, until 1923.", "The Port of Klaipėda remains ice-free throughout the year.", "The Sea Festival has been held annually in July since 1934.", "The Lithuanian Sea Museum is set within a fortress from 1865.", "The Simon Dach Fountain honors the famous poet born in Memel."],
